{
  "chapter": "gear",
  "quests": [
    {
      "key": "gg.gear.intro",
      "title": "Equipment Slots",
      "tier": "LV",
      "desc": [
        "Armor and gear sit in two places. Armor goes in the four armor slots, and so do masks, because GregTech's hazard checks and Galacticraft's air checks only read those slots. Everything else, goggles, back devices and the ammo pouch, goes in Baubles slots: head for goggles, wings for packs and gliders, quiver for the ammo pouch.",
        "Pick up any starter armor to begin: Steam, Scout or Combat. The Steam set is crafted by hand from bronze plates and Heavy Cloth, and the T1 Combat set is built in an assembler. Check NEI for the exact pieces.",
        "[note]Wear every piece of a set for its full bonus. Items in Baubles slots drop when you die unless you keep your inventory.[/note]"
      ],
      "pre": [
        "gg.lv.intro",
        88
