    {
      "key": "gg.gear.medkit",
      "title": "Medkit",
      "tier": "MV",
      "desc": [
        "The Medkit is the best healing item you can carry before the endgame. Use it below full health and, after 50 ticks of use, it heals you 6 health and gives Regeneration II for 20 seconds.",
        "It is built in an MV assembler from two aluminum plates, four Bandages, a Redstone dust and 250 mB of ethanol. Bandages are the LV version of the same idea: steel ring, string, leather and a slimeball. Check NEI."
      ],
