    {
      "key": "gg.gear.gas_mask",
      "title": "Gas Mask",
      "tier": "MV",
      "desc": [
        "The Gas Mask is a helmet-slot item that fully protects you from GregTech's gas hazard (the pollution effects of a polluted area) by itself, and it also cures poison and wither while its filter lasts. It must go in the helmet slot, not a Baubles slot, because GregTech only checks armor slots.",
        "Build it in an MV assembler from five rubber plates, two glass panes, an aluminum plate and a Gas Mask Filter. When the filter runs out, combine the mask with a fresh filter in a crafting grid to refill it.",
        "[note]Gas is the hazard it stops. For radiation or heat you need a full armor set.[/note]"
      ],
      "pre": [
