      "key": "gg.gear.oxygen",
      "title": "Oxygen Mask and Tanks",
      "tier": "HV",
      "desc": [
        "For space and for bad air you need Galacticraft's oxygen gear. The Oxygen Mask goes in the mask slot and the Oxygen Tanks in the tank slots, because Galacticraft reads its own slots.",
        "The Mask takes two plastic plates, two rubber plates and a stainless steel plate. The Tanks take four plastic plates, two Compressed Air Tanks and two stainless plates, and come out empty, so fill them with compressed air. Check NEI."
