      "key": "gg.gear.jump_pack",
      "title": "Jump Pack",
      "tier": "HV",
      "desc": [
        "The Jump Pack is an electric back device for the wings slot. Each jump spends charge and gives you a boost, and it absorbs falls longer than three blocks, up to eight blocks for free, while it has charge. Only one back device fits the wings slot at a time.",
        "Build it in an HV assembler: stainless steel plates and screws, a Glider Backpack, two Compressed Air Tanks, an Electric Piston and an HV circuit. Charge it in a GT charger before you leave."
      ],
